      <h2 class="newsletter-article-title">Intersection Safety Systems Prototyping Accepting Proposals Until July 20 @ 3 PM ET</h2>
      <div class="newsletter-article-content">
        <p>
          The Intersection Safety Systems (ISS) Prototyping Broad Agency Announcement (BAA) is accepting proposals until July 20, 2026. Up to $17M (across all awardees and phases) is available to support ISS prototype development, testing, and deployment under real-world conditions.
        </p>
        <p>
          The goal is to accelerate the development of full end-to-end prototype systems and their components, including sensor fusion, AI-based decision-making, and conflict mitigation. This opportunity is open to any eligible entity, regardless of prior Intersection Safety Challenge participation or prizes won.
        </p>
