    </article>

    <article id="join-the-dot-bots-challenge" class="newsletter-article">
      <figure class="newsletter-image">
        <img src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/USDOTFHWA/2026/06/13938366/bots-logo-challenge-01_original.png" alt="DOT Bots Challenge" />
        <figcaption>Source: USDOT</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <h2 class="newsletter-article-title">Ready, Set, Robot! Join the $1.5 million DOT Bots Challenge Now</h2>
      <div class="newsletter-article-content">
        <p>
          The USDOT proudly announced the launch of the USDOT DOT Bots Challenge in late June 2026. The Challenge offers up to $1.5 million in prize funding for innovative ideas on how advanced robotics technologies can solve public sector transportation challenges, improve infrastructure, and keep travelers and workers safe. Stage I of the Challenge is now open for submissions through August 10, 2026. Full Challenge details, including key dates, eligibility requirements, evaluation criteria, and submission information, can be found in the DOT Bots Challenge Statement.
        </p>
        <div class="newsletter-cta-wrapper align-right">
          <a href="https://urldefense.us/v3/__https://links-2.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:*2F*2Fwww.transportation.gov*2Fpolicy-initiatives*2Fnett*2Frobotics/1/0101019f37926a17-134d2286-03c0-4b7e-ba2f-e6acafed2075-000000/1Clu8cjX-CcYHwzCC8LWpq5pn5_7kcn7KHIplDCvd70=452__;JSUlJSU!!DJ_L93zn18-Ojg!mAIALdMfyE_P1rp1mXIiFy0iNRMhGxytLl31vuD_WCxjec4IAKzfKGRf1pP-WzXAQn1rCAkDcqWIXOXPCcctJt9eSgbhtQ$" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="newsletter-cta"><strong>Enter the DOT Bots Challenge</strong></a>
